NCE ALLOCATION, PATIENT/INSURER RECEIPTS &amp;amp; REVERSALS&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:6px;font-size:12px;color:#52667A&quot;&gt;The model separates eligibility, approval, liability and actual cash receipt—preventing double counting and incorrect outstanding balances.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="30" width="2780" height="70" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p5_formula" value="&lt;b&gt;Controlled invoice formulas&lt;/b&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; subtotal = Σ invoice_line.line_total &amp;nbsp;·&amp;nbsp; approved_insurance = Σ approved claim lines &amp;nbsp;·&amp;nbsp; patient_liability = subtotal − approved_insurance &amp;nbsp;·&amp;nbsp; patient_paid = settled patient payments − reversals &amp;nbsp;·&amp;nbsp; insurer_paid = settled insurer payments − reversals. All recalculation occurs in the same transaction as the causal change." style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;strokeColor=#FCD34D;fillColor=#FFFBEB;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=12;fontSize=11;fontColor=#78350F;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="110" width="2780" height="65" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p5_appt_ref" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-family:Arial,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background:#64748B;color:#FFFFFF;padding:9px 10px;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.2px&quot;&gt;APPOINTMENT&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:9px;font-weight:400;opacity:.85&quot;&gt; · reference&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;padding:5px 9px;border-top:0;font-family:monospace;font-size:9.8px;line-height:1.23;color:#263B50&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight:700;color:#B42318&quot;&gt;PK&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp; appointment_id : BIGINT&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;padding:5px 9px;border-top:1px solid #E9EEF3;font-family:monospace;font-size:9.8px;line-height:1.23;color:#263B50&quot;&gt;&lt;span 